# The Davoi Report (San d'Oria 2-2), Ambrotien's route. Main, a level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with 1-1 and 2-2
# completed (GMs; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out): Ambrotien's script plays 2009 (section 1 has no completed
# check); its finish with option 104 begins the mission. Status 0: Ambrotien answers ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44, and
# a trigger straight after a text plays his script's 2001; status 1 answers the text again. Status 3 (a GM) with the
# Temple Knights Davoi Report: completed before, so 2006, whose finish completes the mission again and takes the
# report. bob, with 1-1 completed and 2-2 current at status 3 and never completed (GMs): Ambrotien plays 2028 with the
# arguments 0, 0, 0, 44 (no handler finishes it).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2006
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=93.4,0,-55.5 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char bob zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=93.4,0,-55.5 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
bob: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport completed
bob: mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport current
login
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 1: his script's 2009
finish option=104                       # begun
trigger Ambrotien                       # status 0: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44
finish-if-event
trigger Ambrotien                       # straight after a text: his script's 2001
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 1                # a GM
trigger Ambrotien                       # status 1: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 3                # a GM
keyitem TempleKnightsDavoiReport
trigger Ambrotien                       # status 3, completed before: 2006
finish                                  # completed again, the report taken
bob: login
bob: missionstatus Sandoria 3           # a GM
bob: trigger Ambrotien                  # status 3, never completed: 2028
bob: finish-if-event
